 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><b>Pointes Protection Association, Peter Gagnon, Lou Simionetti, Patricia Grattan, Gay&nbsp;Gartshore, Rick Gartshore and Glen Stortini</b></p>
